From: krun-gaming
Subject: [PATCH] re-upload wl_shm client buffers on every commit

import_commit memoizes one texture per wlr_buffer. For dma-bufs it shares the client memory, for wl_shm
buffers it is a copy taken on the first commit, so a client that cycles a few shm buffers (Xwayland
without glamor) was shown their first contents forever (3-frame flicker of stale images).
---
--- a/src/rendervulkan.hpp	2026-11-08 05:00:31
+++ b/src/rendervulkan.hpp	2026-11-08 05:00:57
@@ -462,6 +462,7 @@
